      "section": "What I’m watching —",
      "category": "video",
      "title": "One Strange Rock",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "(“Gasp” episode, specifically).** This series is truly incredible. Executive produced by the acclaimed filmmaker [Darren Aronofsky](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/pgfeh9h2kn3845/aHR0cHM6Ly90aW0uYmxvZy8yMDE3LzA5LzA5L2RhcnJlbi1hcm9ub2Zza3kvP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9Y29udmVydGtpdCZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWNvbnZlcnRraXQmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPTViZg==) (director of _Black Swan_, producer of _The Wrestler_, and much more) and hosted by Will Smith (@[willsmith](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/ketmh6h5gkd4n9/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaW5zdGFncmFtLmNvbS93aWxsc21pdGgvP2hsPWVu)), it is unlike any documentary series I’ve ever seen. If interested in digging deeper into Darren’s creative process, you can listen to my interview with him: \"[Filmmaker Darren Aronofsky — Exploring Creativity, Ignoring Critics, and Making Art](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/6mceh8h5vmk0l6/aHR0cHM6Ly90aW0uYmxvZy8yMDE3LzA5LzA5L2RhcnJlbi1hcm9ub2Zza3kvP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9Y29udmVydGtpdCZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWNvbnZlcnRraXQmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPTViZg==).”",
