      "category": "other",
      "title": "San Miguel de Allende",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "A UNESCO World Heritage Site, San Miguel has been ranked “2018 Best Small City in the World” by _Condé Nast Traveler_ (@[CNTraveler](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/77i7h8h6vrk397/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9DTlRyYXZlbGVy)). If you need convincing, check out [this slideshow from _Travel + Leisure_](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/znfghnhk9q40e2/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudHJhdmVsYW5kbGVpc3VyZS5jb20vdHJpcC1pZGVhcy9jaXR5LXZhY2F0aW9ucy9zYW4tbWlndWVsLWRlLWFsbGVuZGUtcGhvdG9zP3NsaWRlPTU4MDM1OCM1ODAzNTg=). Where else should I go in Mexico? Let me [know on Twitter (@tferriss)](https://el2.convertkit-mail2.com/c/5qu8lqg33u7h5g97m/xotph6hp85rxe5/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS90ZmVycmlzcw==) with hashtag #TimInMexico",
